com.oddlabs.tt.player.campaign.VikingIsland1.description,"Some of our men were washed over board near this island... if there are any survivors, we must pick them up.","Nogle af vores m�nd blev skyllet over bord n�r denne �... hvis der er nogen overlevende, m� vi samle dem op.","Einige unserer M�nner sind nahe dieser Insel �ber Bord gegangen ... falls es �berlebende gibt, m�ssen wir sie finden.","Algunos de nuestros hombres fueron lanzados por la borda cerca de esta isla. S� hay alg�n superviviente, debemos encontrarlo.","Alcuni dei nostri uomini sono caduti in mare vicino a quest''isola... se qualcuno � sopravvissuto, dobbiamo trovarlo."
com.oddlabs.tt.player.campaign.VikingIsland1.dialog0,"Some of our men were washed over board near this island, and I think they must have been captured by the natives. Let''s go free them!","Nogle af vores m�nd blev skyllet over bord n�r denne �, og jeg tror de er blevet taget til fange af de indf�dte. Lad os befri dem!","Einige unserer M�nner sind nahe dieser Insel �ber Bord gegangen und wurden bestimmt von den Eingeborenen gefangen genommen. Los, befreien wir sie!","Algunos de nuestros hombres fueron lanzados por la borda cerca de aqu�, y creo que pueden haber sido capturados por los ind�genas. �Vamos a liberarlos!",Alcuni dei nostri uomini sono caduti in mare vicino a quest''isola e penso siano stati catturati dai nativi. Andiamo a liberarli!
com.oddlabs.tt.player.campaign.VikingIsland1.dialog1,"Phew, thanks for freeing us! Let''s go loot something!","Pyha, tak fordi i befriede os! Lad os tage ud og plyndre et eller andet!","Uff, danke f�r die Rettungsaktion! Los, sehen wir, was es zu pl�ndern gibt!","�F�uuu, gracias por liberarnos!... �Vamos a saquear algo!","Phew, grazie per averci liberato! Ed ora andiamo a saccheggiare!"
